{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "暨三十一祖道信大師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "道信大師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "忠國師聞乃云\n欽師猶被馬師惑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "邪舍之藏誌云艮地生玄旨通尊媚亦尊比肩三九族足下一毛分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "邪舍三藏誌云九女出人倫八女絕婚姻朽牀添六脚心祖眾中尊"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "安國師號為破竈墮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄沙云大小石頭和\n被讓師推倒今起不得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄沙云果然雲居錫云只如玄沙道果然是真金是瓦礫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即馬祖大師也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "僧問仰山曰大\n耳三藏第三問為什麼不見國師仰山曰前兩度是涉境心後入自受用三昧所以不見又有僧舉前語問玄沙玄沙曰汝道前兩度還見麼\n玄覺云前兩度若見後來為什麼不見且道利害在什麼處僧問趙州曰大耳三藏第三度不見國師未審國師在什麼處趙州云在三藏鼻\n孔上僧問玄沙既在鼻孔上為什麼不見玄沙云只為太近"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "僧問玄沙國師喚侍者意作麼生玄沙云却是侍者會雲居錫云且道侍者會不會若道會國師又道汝辜負吾若道不會玄沙又云却道侍\n者會且作麼生商量玄覺彼問僧作麼是侍者會處僧云若不會爭解恁麼應玄覺云汝少會在又云若於遮裏商量得去便見玄沙僧問法\n眼國師喚侍者意作麼生法眼云且去別時來雲居錫曰法眼恁道為復明國師意不明國師意僧問趙州國師喚侍者意作麼生趙州云如\n入暗裏書字字雖不成文彩已彰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "長慶稜云大似不知保福展云幾不到和尚此間雲居錫云此二尊者盡扶背後只如南泉休\n去為當扶面前為當扶背後"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄覺云是相見語不是相見誇"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如三平和尚章述之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有僧舉似藥山藥山云縛殺遮漢也僧云和尚如何藥山亦喚云某甲僧\n應諾藥山云是什麼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "曾住五臺山金閣寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲㞐錫云中邑當時若不得仰山遮一句語何處有中邑也崇壽稠云還有人定得\n此道理麼若定不得只是箇弄精魂脚手佛性義在什麼處玄覺云若不是仰山爭得見中邑且道什麼處是仰山得見中邑處"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "眾皆無對"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "藥山目之為百丈下堂句"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舊梵語阿含新云阿\n笈摩即小乘教也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "主飯者目為飯頭主菜者目為菜頭佗皆倣此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三業不善不可共住準律合用梵檀法治之者當驅出院清眾既安恭信生矣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "隨宜懲罰得留法服後必悔之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四來同居聖凡執辯且如\n來應世尚有六羣之黨況今像末豈得全無但見一僧有過便雷例譏誚殊不知以輕眾壞法其損甚大今禪門若稍無妨害\n者宜依百丈叢林格式量事區分且立法防姦不為賢士然寧可有格而無犯不可有犯而無教惟百丈禪師護法之益其大\n\n矣哉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "懷海禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "懷惲禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "普願禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "齊安禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "靈默禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如滿禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法常禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "靈湍禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法常禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "智岩禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "司馬頭陀參禪外蘊人倫之鑒兼窮地理\n諸方刱院多取决焉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即祐師也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄覺云且道過在什麼處"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲居錫云什麼處是溈山勘破仰山處"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲居代云師無異號資福代作\n圓相托起古人頌云不道溈山不道牛一身兩號實難酬離却兩頭應須道如何道得出常流"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼下眾中喚作病在目前不識玄覺云且道大慈識病不識病此僧出來是病不是病\n若言是病每日行住不可揔是病若言不是病出來又作麼生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "沙彌即仰山也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其人無對"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼代云此時但掩耳出去"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦曰東院"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼代云請上坐領某甲卑情同安顯代云是上坐眼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "保壽云射虎不真徒勞沒羽長慶問覺上坐云那僧纔出禮拜為什麼便\n收伊為墼子覺云適來那邊亦有人恁麼問慶云向伊道什麼云也向伊恁麼道玄覺云什麼處却成墼子去\n叢林中道纔出來便成墼子只如每日出入行住坐臥不可揔成墼子也且道遮僧出來具眼不具眼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄覺云前來僧也恁麼道趙州去也怎麼道什麼處是勘破婆子又云非唯被趙州勘破亦被遮僧勘破"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法燈別眾僧云已知去處"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法燈別云莫說似人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同安顯別云老僧遮裏不曾見恁麼人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄覺代云留取供養"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法燈別云我不如汝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "崇壽稠別云和尚是據客置主人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲居錫云趙州為當扶石橋扶掠彴"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲居錫云什麼處是沙彌入門侍者在門外遮裏若\n曾得便見趙州"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲居錫云什麼\n處是趙州販關若撿得出是上坐眼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲居錫云此人具眼不具眼因什麼着打"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲居\n錫云什麼處是趙州被驢撲處"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "趙州云可憐兩箇漠不識轉身句"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "長慶代云合哭不合哭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "保福聞之乃仰手覆手"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諲即徑山第二世法濟大師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "語見興善章"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鳥窠章敘訖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼代云乞命法燈代云但引頸示之玄覺云老兒家放\n却义子得也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自稱大禪佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "溈山靈祐法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大安禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從諗禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "衢州利蹤法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "天龍和尚法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "道常禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大愚和尚法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "洪州黃蘗法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "袁州仰山法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鎮州臨濟法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "州智法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "福州雙峯法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "杭州共諲法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楊州慧覺法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仰山光涌法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "光穆禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "志開禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "魏府存奬法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "沼禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慧然禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "魏府大覺法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄沙云我\n若見即蹋倒鍬子僧問鏡清仰山插鍬意旨如何清云狗銜赦書諸候避道又問只如玄沙蹋鍬其意如何清云勿柰船何打破戽斗又問南山刈\n茅意旨如何清云李靖三兄久經行陣雲居錫云且道鏡清下此一判著不著又僧問禾山云仰山插鍬意旨如何禾山云汝問我僧云玄沙蹋鍬\n意音如何禾山云我問汝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄沙云大小溈山被仰山一坐至今起不得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法燈別云相公不用煩惱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄覺\n云且道如來禪與祖師禪分不分長慶稜云一時坐却"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄覺云金剛經道實無一法然燈佛與我受記佗道實無一法\n可當情為什麼道解猶在境且道利害在什麼處"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼別云喚什麼作燈籠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "洞山別云問底存阿那頭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有僧舉似玄沙玄沙云諦當甚諦當敢保老兄猶未徵眾疑此語玄沙問地藏\n我恁麼道汝作麼生會地藏云不是桂琛則走殺天下人也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦謂米七師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼別云此是什麼時節問法燈別云喚底不是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲山云奯不別前語"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "長慶代眾云美食不中飽人喫玄沙云我當時若見拗折指頭玄覺云且道玄沙恁麼道意作麼生\n雲居錫云只如玄沙恁麼道肯伊不肯伊若肯何言拗折指頭若不肯俱𦙆過在什麼處先曹山云俱胝承當處鹵莽只認得一機一境一種是拍\n手拊掌是佗西園竒怪玄覺又云且道俱胝還悟也未若悟為什麼道承當處鹵莽若不悟又道用一指頭禪不盡且道曹山意旨在什麼處"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "禾山\n代云爭得到遮裏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "溈山\n因仰山侍立次方舉此話未了仰山便問钁在黃蘗手裏為什麼被臨濟奪却溈山曰賊是小人智過君子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "溈山舉問仰山且道黃蘗後語但囑臨濟為復別有意旨仰山曰亦囑臨濟亦記向後溈山云向後作麼生仰山云\n一人指南吳越令行南塔和尚注云獨坐震威此記方出又云若遇大風此記亦出溈山云如是如是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "後雪峯聞乃曰臨齊大似白枯賊"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "住本山薛老峯亦云丁墓山時稱老觀和尚"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師對機多用此語故時人因號骨剉和尚"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "歸宗下亦有大禪佛名智通終於五臺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "後人舉似玄沙玄沙云更學三十年未會禪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "趙州云只遮一縫尚不柰何乃代云且釘遮一縫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其僧後問長慶為什麼不出是長慶\n云汝擬喚作什麼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "首山省念和尚云據天平作恁麼會解未夢見西院在何故話在"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼別云大似相違"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "東禪齊云只如\n雪峯是會石霜意不會石霜意若會也佗為什麼道死㥯若不會什麼生雪峯豈可不會然法且無異奈以師承不同解之差\n別佗云徧界不曾藏也須曾學來始得會亂說即不可"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "太原孚上座代云先師靈骨猶在"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "長慶稜云既知有為什麼恁麼道又云養子方知父慈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同安顯別云不知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "保福別云佛非法眼別云方便呼為佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "僧問曹山先師道吾常於此切意作麼生曹山云要頭即斫將去又問雪峯雪峯以拄杖擬之云我亦曾到洞山來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "眾無對"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "與石室問荅如彼章出之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲巖代云無手脚者始解打"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "義存"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文邃"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "德山果三年後\n\n示滅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲居錫云什麼處是祖師龍頭蛇尾便好喫棒只如雪峯自道我也好喫\n拄杖且道佛法意旨作麼生久在眾上座無有不知初機兄弟且作麼生會東禪濟云雪峯恁麼道為當點檢別有落處眾中喚作\n自抽過抽過且置祖師道不是風動不是幡動且作麼生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "東禪齊云什麼處是蹉過的當蹉過莫便恁麼會也無若恁麼會即未會溈山意在只如雪峯云溈山古佛子教去\n懺悔是證明溈山是讚歎溈山古事也難子細好見去也不難矣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼代云大眾看此一貟戰將"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼別云官人何得貴耳而賤目"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼代拊掌三下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲居錫云什麼處是長慶向第二頭道處"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "歸宗柔別云和尚只解問人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄覺因舉法眼見僧擔土乃以一塊土放擔上云吾助汝僧云謝和尚慈悲法眼不肯有一僧別云\n\n和尚是什麼心行法眼便休玄覺徵云此三則語一般別有道理什麼處是心行處"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄覺云什麼處是山鬼窟叢林中道住在不去不住處便是山\n鬼窟所以打破如此商量正是鬼窟且道保福打伊意作麼生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦號三生藏也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同安代云迴頭即勿交涉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同安代云動即失"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦號鹿頭和尚"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "先住貞谿"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼別云飽叢林"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "韶州文偃法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "台州瑞嵒法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "懷州彥禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "福州道閑法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "婺州德謙禪師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "安州白兆志圓法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "潭州藤霞法嗣蘄州志操禪師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "潭州雲蓋景和尚法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "廬山懷惲法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "池州章禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "洪州雲居懷岳法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "襄州鹿門處真法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "撫州曹山慧霞法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "華州草庵法義法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "襄州含珠審哲法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鳳翔住興元和尚一法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "襄州獻禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "廣德義和尚法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "中澄法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彥賔法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鳳翔青峯法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "漳州桂琛法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "道希法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "婺州寶資法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "杭州志球法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "可傳法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "潭州慧輪法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "詔州白雲祥和尚法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "朗州緣密法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "西川澄遠法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鄂州誨機法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "婺州德謙法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "朗州智泆法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "安州懷楚法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "襄州智靜法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "襄州慧徹法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "洪州安志法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "德延和尚法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平生行脚事畢珍重"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "將謂是箇爛柯仙元來却是樗蒲漢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "朋彥即廣法大師後嗣天台國師住蘓州長壽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喪問國界安寧為什麼珠不現師曰落在什麼處"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "神曰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "經出且道此經出且道此經是何人說師曰說與"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無為法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "後同羅山在疾師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以何"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如何"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "子兒師曰毛頭排宇宙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "婺𠜳金柱義昭照和尚有新到僧㕘師揭簾以手作除帽子勢僧問"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乘白"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "弟三世住"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "弟四世住"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "弟七世住"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼別云還有也未"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有什麼交涉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "萬象師曰不撥萬象"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師方悟師上堂曰具足凡夫法凡夫不知具足"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "曰穿破汝心曰如何是芥子師曰塞却汝眼曰如何納師曰把將須󳇐與芥子來曰前言何在師曰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "度迷津師曰汝莫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孔道將一句來僧問如何是寶華境師曰前頭綠水後面青山僧曰不會師曰末後一句師問僧什麼處來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "餘諸辭句與夫禪宗旨趣冥會略錄十首及師製十二時頌編于別卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "時謂嵩頭陀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "單三複三具足一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法譬為複"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生滅四諦"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無量"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無作四諦唯法華圓理乃至治生產業一色一香無非實相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四證三接廣如本教"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "真俗中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第十四祖龍樹菩薩偈云因緣所生法我說即是空亦名為假名亦名中道義斯與楞嚴圓覺經說奢摩佗三摩鉢底禪\n那三觀名目雖殊其致一也達磨大師以心傳心不帶名數直為上上根智俾忘筌忘意故與此教同而不同智者禪師窮理\n盡性備足之門故與禪宗異而非異也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "執名相者不信即心即佛覩此而生信也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起信論云以有妄想心故能知名義自此已下簡暗證者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "圓教外凡也圓觀五陰為不思議境即五品位大師示居此位別教十信及藏通教皆名資糧位"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內凡也圓伏無明入十信鐵輪位不斷見思惑至七\n信以去見思惑自󷴑得六根清淨如經云父母所生眼悉見三千界云云思大禪師示居此位若別教乃地前三十心也藏通皆名\n加行位楞嚴經唯識論三十心後別立四加行名位雖同詮󳋩迥異惟通悟者善巧融會"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "發圓初住即銅輪位也如龍女一念\n成佛現百界身從此轉勝至等覺位凡四十一心盡目真因分位雖殊圓理無別若別教即名十地藏通皆言見道位"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "妙覺\n也起信云始本不二名究竟覺仁王名寂滅上忍也別教權佛攝對圓行第二位耳藏通二教佛可知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不屈不濫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三寶三德屬對交終\n乃至十種三法含攝無遺偈云道識性般若菩提大乘身涅槃三寶德一一皆三法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法性土也法身居之身土相稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "攝二受用也自受用土報佛自居佗受用土登地菩薩所居"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "並為應化土也地前菩薩二乘凡夫所居"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "悉徧也檀翻名施禪師之法徧施有情隨根得益如云世界悉檀生歡喜益云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法華玄義文句大小止觀金光明仁王淨名涅槃請觀音十六觀經等及四教禪門凡百餘軸"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "趙州\n沙彌舉似和尚趙州代豐干云文殊文殊"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "名犯太祖廟諱\n一字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上烏罪切下奴罪切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "歸宗柔和尚別云歸去來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄覺徵云什麼處是\n世尊舉鞭處雲居錫云要會麼如今歸堂去復是阿誰東禪齊拈云什麼處是外道悟處眾中道世尊良久時便是舉鞭\n處恁麼會還得已否"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲居\n錫云有情去也且從只如山河大地是無情之物作麼生說亦隨王去底道理"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼代云弟子鏁大師鏁法燈代云還我鏁𢁈\n來又老宿代云吉州鏁虔州鏁"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼代拊掌三下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼舉云且道借伊樣子不借伊樣子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄覺徵云什麼處是欠半藏處且道那箇婆子具什麼眼便恁麼道"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼\n代云正是習氣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音西"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄覺徵云且道\n讚歎語不肯語若是讚歎為什麼道鼠糞污却若不肯佗有什麼過驗得麼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄沙云大小肈\n法師臨死猶䆿語"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼別云不會古人語"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼別云汝作什麼來法燈別云非公境界"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼代云識得汝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "歸宗柔代云能有幾人知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "天台國師代云無漏不是聖僧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "杭州天龍機和尚代云是\n伊為什麼不去岸上死"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "歸宗柔代云好放處"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼別云誰是不足者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼代云心期滿處即知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師自代云尋香來禮拜和尚"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "南泉代側身而立"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "歸宗柔代云比回歸去敢請流通"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "歸宗柔別云謝和尚再三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法燈代云但將衣袖掩面"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼\n自代云佗是孝順之子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼代云此是基法師語"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼別云太傅識大師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄覺徵云只如此二尊者語還有親踈也無"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "院主無對"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "洞山代云被佗覔得也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲門代云只疑老漢大覺云得即得猶未\n見臨濟機在"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "歸宗柔別云不\n\n因和尚不得到遮裏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼代云不勞如此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼代云恁麼\n即弟子不注也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自別云和尚今日似減"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "東禪齊云眾中道如喪父母何有閑暇恁麼會還息得人疑情麼除此外且作麼生會龍牙意"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "東禪齊云好言語且作麼生會甞問一僧佗道無手底人何更行得舉也及問伊佛法伊\n便休去將知路布說得無用處不如子細體取古人意好"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "歸宗柔代云也要知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "歸宗柔代云留與人增價"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法燈代云咄叱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法澄代云怕佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法燈代云謝和尚證明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼別云此猶是揀底"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼代云未足醻恩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼代云恁麼即不去也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "東禪齊云此二尊宿語明伊問處不明伊問處若明伊問處還得盡善也未試斷看忽然向伊道你指示我更要荅話又作麼生會\n莫道又荅一轉子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "東禪齊云上坐道是\n鳩子聲便成謗去什麼處是謗處若道不是還得麼上坐且道玄覺意作麼生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "東禪齊云那僧聞了忽然惺去更不佗遊\n上坐如今還得麼若不會每日見箇什麼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法燈代云沒念什麼經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法澄代云是弟子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五雲代云興猶未已"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五雲曰什麼處是勘破雲門處要會麼法眼亦被後僧勘破也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師自代云被眼礙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "直庚切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音折"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即五洩小師也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "中大夫尚書吏部侍郎㕘知政事柱國琅邪郡開國公食邑二千九百戶食實封肆伯戶賜紫金魚袋臣王　隨　撰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "臣濟滿"}
